02:00047E16 6104            	  3965:     bsr     _L_z07_MoveObject_ApplyQSpeedToPosition
02:00047E18 61000002        	  3966:     bsr     _L_z07_MoveObject_ApplyQSpeedToPosition
                            	  3967:     even
